      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carrum_Downs"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Local Village on Dandenong‑Frankston Road features about 12 shops, including an IGA, bakery, and a doctor’s office.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
